{"a":[14,14],"h":"<p>14.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 86.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 34.4 42.7 42.7 49.4 49.4 56.2 63.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"63.0 69.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Onlara kıtal ediniz: Harbe girişiniz ki <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"182\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 182.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 44.3 44.3 53.3 53.3 60.0 66.7 66.7 73.6 82.6 82.6 89.3 89.3 89.3 96.0 103.6 119.3 119.3 128.3 128.3 136.6 136.6 143.3 143.3 143.3 152.3 159.0 159.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"60.0 152.3 165.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah sizin ellerinizle onları muazzeb kılsın. -Harbin acılarını tatsınlar, maktul, mecruh, esir olsunlar. Can ve maldden zayiat versinler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 86.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 34.6 34.6 42.0 42.0 54.7 54.7 61.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"61.6 69.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve onları zelil-ü makhur<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"145\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 145.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 33.7 33.7 40.4 47.3 65.3 65.3 74.3 74.3 85.4 85.4 93.0 93.0 107.3 107.3 114.0 120.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.4 47.3 114.0 120.7 129.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve hey'eti mecmuanızla sizi üzerlerine mansur, muzaffer ve galib eylesin<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"211\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 211.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.4 40.4 47.3 47.3 47.3 55.4 55.4 71.3 71.3 78.0 78.0 86.3 102.0 110.3 118.4 118.4 127.4 127.4 150.0 150.0 168.0 168.0 180.0 186.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 86.3 102.0 180.0 186.7 195.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bir takım mü'minlerin sadirlerine şifa versin- Huzaîler gibi onlarnı eza ve cefalarını çekmiş, kıtalde bulunanamış, halleri yürekler acısı olmuş bir takım mü'minlerin gönüllerinde dert bırakmasın teşeffii sadrettir. Sin 15. </p>"}